    "BKF_idea_remnant_francophilia": "Remnant Francophilia",
    "BKF_idea_remnant_francophilia_desc": "The nation of Haute-Volta was one of the rare former French colonies to see cooperation as the only way forward diplomatically and economically, and as the only way to ensure stability.\n\nWhile the Francophiles are slowly getting replaced, one by one, the ghost of French colonialism remains present behind every decision Haute-Volta's government makes.",
